      "after_committing": "普通取消不打断提交；完整提交成功为COMPLETED。",
      "hard_exit_during_commit": "INTERRUPTED，下次基于原可信快照重新完整15次审查。",
      "expected": "NO_FALSE_COMPLETION_OR_FALSE_CANCEL_SUCCESS"
